Third-party material redistributed under device_provenance/ is not covered by
the licence above and retains its own terms:

  modelcard.nmos, modelcard_trap.nmos
      Derived from the sample NMOS model card in BSIM-CMG release 110.0.0,
      distributed by the BSIM Group, University of California, Berkeley
      (https://bsim.berkeley.edu/models/bsimcmg/). modelcard_trap.nmos differs
      from the distributed card only in the value of DVTSHIFT.

The ngspice simulator (https://ngspice.sourceforge.io/), used to produce
idvg.csv and idvg_trap.csv, is not redistributed here; it is obtained from the
project directly, as described in device_provenance/README.md.
